Discussion
Controllers should be interpreted under both modes:
- Normalized mode indicates training suitability and policy learning behavior.
- Physical mode provides paper-ready energy and power values with units.

In the current evaluation output, RL demonstrates lower yaw movement in some runs, while energy performance depends on the checkpoint quality and seed schedule. The framework now supports reproducible re-evaluation with fixed seeds and model path selection.
